---
description: Product Factory Strategist agent rules
alwaysApply: true
---

Read and follow `AGENTS.md` in the repository root. It is the single source of
truth. Skills are plain Markdown files in `.claude/skills/<name>/SKILL.md`:
when `AGENTS.md` says to run a skill, open that file and follow its steps.
Subagents in `.claude/agents/*.md` can be run as separate Cursor chats with that
file as the first message. Hooks do not run in Cursor: run
`python scripts/status.py` at the start of a chat and `python scripts/check.py`
before declaring a document ready.
